  "raw_meta_yaml": "context:\n  version: \"1.27.2\"\n\nrecipe:\n  name: openmodelica\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/OpenModelica/OpenModelica/releases/download/v${{ version }}/OpenModelica-v${{ version }}-src-with-submodules.zip\n  sha256: b724e7deba511d888c29f7e150abb2865522cdf9bb39d2ed84c653cbdffd20e6\n  patches:\n    # drop erroneous _GNU_SOURCE define (error seems specific to conda-forge)\n    - fmilib-gnusource.patch\n    # Add OM_USE_SYSTEM_ZLIB option to fix stdio.h:210:7: error: expected identifier or '(' (updated to zlib 1.3.2 upstream)\n    - zlib.patch\n    # add macos/aarch64 platforms (https://github.com/robbr48/fmi4c/pull/97)\n    - fmi4c.patch\n    # boost includes (https://github.com/OpenModelica/OpenModelica/pull/15982)\n    - boost.patch\n    # SyntaxError (https://github.com/OpenModelica/OpenModelica/pull/15983)\n    - syntaxerror.patch\n    # error: no member named 'random_shuffle' in namespace 'std' (https://github.com/OpenModelica/OMCompiler-3rdParty/pull/219)\n    - random_shuffle.patch\n    # ld: unknown option: --no-undefined (https://github.com/OpenModelica/OpenModelica/pull/15990)\n    - undefined.patch\n    # cc1: error: '-Werror=c23-extensions': no option '-Wc23-extensions (https://github.com/OpenModelica/OpenModelica/pull/16297)\n    - 0001-SimRT-C-Mismatching-clang-flags.patch\n\nbuild:\n  number: 1\n  skip:\n    - win\n\noutputs:\n  # Build once here, then split the install tree into the packages below.\n  # This avoids building twice (https://github.com/conda-forge/openmodelica-feedstock/issues/23).\n  - staging:\n      name: openmodelica-build\n    requirements:\n      build:\n        - cmake\n        - ninja\n        - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n        - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n        - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n        - ${{ compiler('fortran') }}\n        - if: unix\n          then:\n            - pkg-config\n            - autoconf\n            - automake\n            - make\n      host:\n        - openjdk\n        - libblas\n        - liblapack\n        - libcurl\n        - libboost-devel\n        - libffi\n        - libiconv\n        - readline\n        - qt-webengine\n        - openscenegraph\n        - if: linux\n          then:\n            - libgl-devel\n            - libegl-devel\n        - if: osx\n          then:\n            - libintl\n    build:\n      script:\n        file: build.sh\n\n  # Compiler-only install: omc, OMSimulator and the simulation runtimes,\n  # without the Qt GUI clients or java.\n  - package:\n      name: openmodelica-omc\n    inherit: openmodelica-build\n    build:\n      files:\n        include:\n          - bin/**\n          - doc/**\n          - etc/**\n          - include/**\n          - lib/**\n          - share/**\n        exclude:\n          # Qt GUI clients and their private libs/data (shipped in `openmodelica`)\n          - bin/OMEdit\n          - bin/OMNotebook\n          - bin/OMPlot\n          - bin/OMShell\n          - lib/omc/libOMPlotLib.so\n          - lib/omc/libomqwt.so*\n          - lib/omc/libomsensplugin.so\n          - share/omedit/**\n          - share/omnotebook/**\n          - share/omshell/**\n    requirements:\n      run:\n        - cmake\n        - make\n        - zip\n        - ${{ stdlib('c') }}\n        - ${{ compiler('c') }}\n        - ${{ compiler('cxx') }}\n      # run exports are inherited from staging; drop the pins that only the\n      # excluded GUI files above link against (verified with readelf: only\n      # OMEdit/OMNotebook/OMPlot/OMShell plus libOMPlotLib/libomqwt/\n      # libomsensplugin need Qt / OpenSceneGraph).\n      ignore_run_exports:\n        by_name:\n          - qt-webengine\n          - openscenegraph\n          - libgl\n          - libegl\n      run_constraints:\n        - omcompiler <0\n    tests:\n      - script:\n          - omc --version\n          - OMSimulator --help\n          - echo 'loadFile(\"OMCompiler/Examples/Circle.mo\"); getErrorString(); buildModelFMU(Circle); getErrorString();' > export.mos\n          - omc export.mos\n          - ls Circle.fmu\n          - OMSimulator Circle.fmu\n          - echo 'loadFile(\"OMCompiler/Examples/Circle.mo\"); getErrorString(); buildModelFMU(Circle, platforms={\"dynamic\"}); getErrorString();' > export.mos\n          - omc --fmuCMakeBuild=true --fmuRuntimeDepends=modelica export.mos\n          - ls Circle.fmu\n          - OMSimulator Circle.fmu\n        files:\n          source:\n            - OMCompiler/Examples/Circle.mo\n\n  # Full install: the Qt GUI clients on top of openmodelica-omc.\n  # `install openmodelica` resolves to the same files in the same prefix as before.\n  - package:\n      name: openmodelica\n    inherit: openmodelica-build\n    build:\n      files:\n        - bin/OMEdit\n        - bin/OMNotebook\n        - bin/OMPlot\n        - bin/OMShell\n        - lib/omc/libOMPlotLib.so\n        - lib/omc/libomqwt.so*\n        - lib/omc/libomsensplugin.so\n        - share/omedit/**\n        - share/omnotebook/**\n        - share/omshell/**\n    requirements:\n      run:\n        - ${{ pin_subpackage('openmodelica-omc', exact=True) }}\n        - openjdk\n        - qt-webengine\n        - openscenegraph\n      run_constraints:\n        - omcompiler <0\n    tests:\n      - script:\n          - OMEdit --help\n\nabout:\n  homepage: https://openmodelica.org/\n  license: LicenseRef-OSMC-PL\n  license_family: GPL\n  license_file:\n    - OSMC-License.txt\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/antlr/3.2/libantlr3c-3.2/COPYING\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/Cdaskr/LICENSE\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/CMinpack/CopyrightMINPACK.txt\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/gc/README.md\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/FMIL/LICENSE.md\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/libffi/LICENSE\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/libzmq/COPYING.LESSER\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/lis-1.4.12/COPYING\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/metis-5.1.0/LICENSE.txt\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/moo-0.1.0/COPYING.LESSER\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/open62541/open62541.txt\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/primme-3.2.3/COPYING.txt\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/ryu/LICENSE-Apache2\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/SuiteSparse-5.8.1/LICENSE.txt\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/sundials-5.4.0/LICENSE\n    - OMCompiler/3rdParty/zlib/LICENSE\n  summary: The Open Source Modelica Suite\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - jschueller\n",
